flowchart TD
Start["**Start**<br/>Run MOO optimization"]
DecisionVars["**Decision Variables**<br/>Six buffer capacities<br/>Discrete domain {1-10}"]
NSGA2Algo["**NSGA2 Algorithm**<br/>Population based multi objective search<br/>Uses sampling crossover mutation"]
ProblemClass["**BufferCapacityProblem**<br/>Defines variable bounds and evaluation interface<br/>Holds n replications and base seed"]
EvaluateIndividuals["**Evaluate Individuals**<br/>Validate integer caps and bounds<br/>Prepare evaluation tasks for valid individuals"]
ParallelEval["**Parallel Evaluation**<br/>Multiprocessing pool with exact cores 50<br/>Map tasks to worker processes"]
EvalSingle["**evaluate single individual**<br/>Validate caps again<br/>Run multiple replications<br/>Return objectives wip and negative throughput"]
RunSimCaps["**run simulation with caps**<br/>Build production line using given capacities<br/>Warmup reset and sample WIP and throughput"]
RunSim["**run simulation**<br/>Construct machines and buffers<br/>Simulate event driven production<br/>Collect machine stats and outputs"]
MachineClass["**Machine Class**<br/>Processes parts and models breakdowns<br/>Tracks working waiting blocked times and energy"]
DelayBufferClass["**DelayBuffer Class**<br/>Capacitated buffer with delay tokens<br/>Tracks ready and in transit counts"]
AggregateResults["**Aggregate Results**<br/>Average throughput and WIP over replications<br/>Produce objectives for NSGA2"]
NSGA2Update["**NSGA2 Update**<br/>Assign fitness and perform selection<br/>Elitism and variation produce next generation"]
Termination["**Termination**<br/>Stop after configured number of generations"]
ExportCSV["**Export CSV**<br/>Write valid evaluated history to results folder<br/>Exclude invalid individuals"]
End["**End**<br/>Pareto front and history exported"]

Start --> DecisionVars
DecisionVars --> NSGA2Algo
NSGA2Algo --> ProblemClass
ProblemClass --> EvaluateIndividuals
EvaluateIndividuals --> ParallelEval
ParallelEval --> EvalSingle
EvalSingle --> RunSimCaps
RunSimCaps --> RunSim
RunSim --> MachineClass
RunSim --> DelayBufferClass
MachineClass --> RunSim
DelayBufferClass --> RunSim
RunSim --> EvalSingle
EvalSingle --> AggregateResults
AggregateResults --> NSGA2Update
NSGA2Update --> NSGA2Algo
NSGA2Algo --> Termination
Termination --> ExportCSV
ExportCSV --> End